<title>JAPAN: Chiba Kogyo Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chiba Kogyo Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    33.53		vs	   42.71</p>
<p> Operating	    4.88		vs	    7.00</p>
